{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-common-biology-22","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"biology","number":22,"points":2,"unitId":"signaling","unitLabel":"세포 신호전달","topic":"G단백질·cAMP","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["signaling","digestion"],"stem":"그림은 소장 상피세포에서 콜레라 독소의 작용을 나타낸 것이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 세포 내 cAMP의 증가로 음이온 채널이 활성화된다.\nㄴ. G 단백질에 결합한 GTP가 콜레라 독소의 기질로 사용된다.\nㄷ. ADPR은 콜레라 독소에 의해 ATP와 포도당이 반응하여 \n형성된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t008"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t009"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":672,"height":276,"region":0,"bbox":[34.28,33.703,268.8,110.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-22/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":246,"height":51,"region":0,"bbox":[206.68,158.903,98.4,20.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-22/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":775,"height":226,"region":0,"bbox":[12.28,229.703,310.0,90.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-22/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":12,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.297,759.1,516.082],"width":328.98,"height":363.785,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[34.28,33.703,268.8,110.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[206.68,158.903,98.4,20.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-03","bbox":[12.28,229.703,310.0,90.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"